---
import BaseLayout from '../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout title="Join Us | SNU Connectome Laboratory">
  <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 py-16 space-y-16">
    <!-- Header -->
    <div class="max-w-3xl space-y-4">
      <div class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 px-3.5 py-1.5 rounded-full bg-cyan-950/70 border border-cyan-800/60 text-cyan-300 text-xs font-mono">
        <span class="w-2 h-2 rounded-full bg-cyan-400 animate-pulse"></span>
        <span>OPEN CALL FOR 2026</span>
      </div>
      <h1 class="text-4xl sm:text-5xl font-black text-white tracking-tight">
        Join the Connectome AI Journey
      </h1>
      <p class="text-slate-300 text-sm sm:text-base leading-relaxed">
        We are actively recruiting passionate, intellectually curious graduate students (PhD / MS-PhD / MS), postdoctoral fellows, and undergraduate research interns.
      </p>
    </div>

    <!-- Special Highlight: QML Research Internship -->
    <div class="p-8 sm:p-12 rounded-3xl neural-gradient text-slate-950 shadow-2xl space-y-6">
      <div class="flex items-center gap-3">
        <span class="px-3 py-1 rounded-full bg-slate-950 text-cyan-300 font-mono text-xs font-bold uppercase">
          Special Recruitment Call
        </span>
        <span class="font-bold text-slate-900 text-xs">양자머신러닝(QML) 연구 인턴 모집</span>
      </div>

      <h2 class="text-2xl sm:text-4xl font-black tracking-tight leading-tight">
        Quantum Machine Learning (QML) for High-Dimensional Brain Connectomics
      </h2>

      <p class="text-sm text-slate-900 leading-relaxed font-medium">
        서울대학교 차지욱 교수님의 커넥톰(Connectome) 연구실에서 양자컴퓨터의 계산 능력(Quantum Circuit / Entanglement / Kernels)을 최첨단 머신러닝에 접목하여 복잡한 뇌 커넥톰 및 생체 데이터를 분석할 열정적인 연구 인턴을 찾습니다.
      </p>

      <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-3 gap-4 pt-2">
        <div class="p-4 rounded-2xl bg-white/80 backdrop-blur-md space-y-1">
          <div class="text-xs font-bold text-slate-950">⚛️ 주요 연구 주제</div>
          <p class="text-xs text-slate-700">파라미터화된 양자 회로(PQC), 양자 커널 추정, 뇌 연결성 그래프 분류</p>
        </div>
        <div class="p-4 rounded-2xl bg-white/80 backdrop-blur-md space-y-1">
          <div class="text-xs font-bold text-slate-950">💻 활용 기술 및 환경</div>
          <p class="text-xs text-slate-700">PennyLane, Qiskit, PyTorch, 고성능 GPU/QPU 시뮬레이션 클러스터</p>
        </div>
        <div class="p-4 rounded-2xl bg-white/80 backdrop-blur-md space-y-1">
          <div class="text-xs font-bold text-slate-950">🎯 지원 자격</div>
          <p class="text-xs text-slate-700">컴퓨터공학, 물리학, 전기전자, 수리과학, 인공지능 등 양자-AI에 열정을 가진 분</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <!-- Graduate Tracks Grid -->
    <div class="space-y-8">
      <div class="space-y-2">
        <h2 class="text-xs font-mono uppercase tracking-widest text-cyan-400 font-bold">Academic Degree Programs</h2>
        <h3 class="text-2xl sm:text-3xl font-black text-white">Graduate Programs at SNU</h3>
      </div>

      <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-3 gap-6">
        <div class="p-8 rounded-3xl glass-panel border border-slate-800 space-y-4">
          <div class="w-10 h-10 rounded-2xl bg-cyan-500/20 border border-cyan-500/30 flex items-center justify-center text-cyan-300 font-bold">
            01
          </div>
          <h4 class="text-lg font-bold text-white">협동과정 인공지능 전공 (GSAI)</h4>
          <p class="text-xs text-slate-400 font-mono">Interdisciplinary Program in AI</p>
          <p class="text-xs text-slate-300 leading-relaxed">
            파운데이션 모델(NeuroMamba, DIVER-0), 4D 시공간 표현학습, 기하학적 딥러닝 및 대규모 멀티모달 뇌 AI 연구.
          </p>
        </div>

        <div class="p-8 rounded-3xl glass-panel border border-slate-800 space-y-4">
          <div class="w-10 h-10 rounded-2xl bg-indigo-500/20 border border-indigo-500/30 flex items-center justify-center text-indigo-300 font-bold">
            02
          </div>
          <h4 class="text-lg font-bold text-white">뇌인지과학과 (BCS)</h4>
          <p class="text-xs text-slate-400 font-mono">Dept. of Brain & Cognitive Sciences</p>
          <p class="text-xs text-slate-300 leading-relaxed">
            fMRI 생성 모델링, 가상 뇌 시뮬레이션, 인지 역동성 해독, 다중모달 뇌-행동 연결성 연구.
          </p>
        </div>

        <div class="p-8 rounded-3xl glass-panel border border-slate-800 space-y-4">
          <div class="w-10 h-10 rounded-2xl bg-rose-500/20 border border-rose-500/30 flex items-center justify-center text-rose-300 font-bold">
            03
          </div>
          <h4 class="text-lg font-bold text-white">심리학과 (Psychology)</h4>
          <p class="text-xs text-slate-400 font-mono">Department of Psychology</p>
          <p class="text-xs text-slate-300 leading-relaxed">
            계산정신의학, 다중오믹스 유전체(PRS)와 뇌연결성, 아동청소년 우울증 조기 예측 및 환경 상호작용.
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <!-- Application Guide Box -->
    <div class="p-8 sm:p-12 rounded-3xl glass-panel border border-slate-800 space-y-8">
      <div class="space-y-2">
        <h2 class="text-xs font-mono uppercase tracking-widest text-cyan-400 font-bold">How to Apply</h2>
        <h3 class="text-2xl sm:text-3xl font-black text-white">Application Guidelines</h3>
      </div>

      <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 gap-8 text-xs text-slate-300 leading-relaxed">
        <div class="space-y-3">
          <h4 class="font-bold text-cyan-300 text-sm">준비 서류 (Required Materials)</h4>
          <ul class="space-y-2">
            <li class="flex items-start gap-2">
              <span class="text-cyan-400">1.</span>
              <span><strong>Curriculum Vitae (CV)</strong>: 주요 학력, 연구 경험, 프로젝트 및 기술 스택</span>
            </li>
            <li class="flex items-start gap-2">
              <span class="text-cyan-400">2.</span>
              <span><strong>성적 증명서 (Transcripts)</strong></span>
            </li>
            <li class="flex items-start gap-2">
              <span class="text-cyan-400">3.</span>
              <span><strong>연구 관심 분야 기술서 (Brief Statement of Interest)</strong>: 커넥톰랩의 어떤 주제(LBM, QML, 유전체, fMRI/EEG 등)에 관심이 있는지 1-2단락 기술</span>
            </li>
          </ul>
        </div>

        <div class="space-y-3">
          <h4 class="font-bold text-cyan-300 text-sm">지원 및 문의처 (Contact)</h4>
          <p>
            아래 이메일로 위 서류들을 첨부하여 보내주시면 개별 검토 후 인터뷰 일정을 안내해 드립니다.
          </p>
          <div class="pt-2">
            <a
              href="mailto:connectome@snu.ac.kr?subject=[Connectome Lab Application] Name"
              class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 px-6 py-3 rounded-2xl bg-gradient-to-r from-cyan-500 to-blue-600 hover:from-cyan-400 hover:to-blue-500 text-slate-950 font-bold text-xs shadow-lg shadow-cyan-500/20 transition"
            >
              <span>Send Application Email</span>
              <span>📧 connectome@snu.ac.kr</span>
            </a>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</BaseLayout>
